values ('fq_merid_060', 'The Harbinger Deal', 'boss', 'S', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'THE FINAL TRANSACTION. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, Don Vercelli) The Abyss Harbinger has destabilized the void energy market with uncontrolled inflation. The Cartel closes this deal permanently. Defeat the Raid Boss Tier-2 entity and stabilize the market. Profit is the only law.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 59, "reputation_required": 3480, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_059"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "ABYSS_HARBINGER", "count": 1, "desc": "CLOSE THE HARBINGER DEAL.", "description": "Defeat Abyss Harbinger (x1)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "abyss_fragment", "count": 1, "desc": "Claim the market stabilization asset.", "description": "Collect abyss fragment (x1). [Item: Abyss Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 15000, "currency": 7500, "crd": 3750, "rep": 5000, "items": [{"item_id": "void_core", "quantity": 5}, {"item_id": "event_horizon_fragment_l", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "con_elite_recovery_pack", "quantity": 10}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_061', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 59)
